{"id":"fortaleza","lemma":"fortaleza","pos":"noun","rank":2793,"glosses":["fortress","fortitude","strength"],"ipa":"/foɾtaˈleθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fortalezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fortaleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Todo el mundo tiene fortalezas y debilidades.","en":"Everyone has strengths and weaknesses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733068","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"debility","l":"debilidad"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"everyone, everybody"]]},{"text":"La fortaleza era verdaderamente inexpugnable.","en":"The fortress was truly impenetrable.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"truthfully"},null]},{"text":"Tom luchó con toda su fortaleza.","en":"Tom fought with all his might.","words":[null,{"g":"to fight","l":"luchar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Toda nación, rica o pobre, tiene sus fortalezas y sus debilidades.","en":"Every nation, rich or poor, has its strengths and weaknesses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693429","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"nation"},{"g":"fenugreek"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"poor"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"debility","l":"debilidad"}]},{"text":"Un guerrero asimila su fortaleza y debilidad.","en":"The warrior is conscious of both his strength and his weakness.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"warrior"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"debility"}]}]}